# Bundle payloads for the private review repository are opaque byte-for-byte
# copies whose SHA-256 digests are recorded in release/private-repo/manifest.json
# and verified by expand_bundle.py and validate_bundle.py. Git must never
# normalize their line endings: on a fresh clone with core.autocrlf=true every
# digest would otherwise fail, and the destination files are consumed by Linux
# Actions runners that require LF.
release/private-repo/files/** -text
